\newlabel{fig:12-pretrained}{{11}{14}{Pretrained word embeddings on the lower-cased-word channel. Fine-tuning destroys the pretrained structure ($-$2.3 vs.\^^Mrandom); freezing partially recovers (+5.5); stacking pretrained vectors on top of \texttt {final04} drops macro-F1 by \textbf {$-$5.7}. spaCy \texttt {md} is trained on generic news text and carries the wrong priors for drug names}{figure.caption.23}{}}
